# ADHD Chaos Party - Environment Variables Configuration

# 1. Real-time Node Server (Deploy to Render.com)
# When deploying the server to Render, paste the web service URL here.
# If left blank, it defaults to localhost:3001 in dev.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://your-render-backend-url.onrender.com

# 2. Global Leaderboard Database (Supabase)
# Create a free database on Supabase.com, make a table named "leaderboard"
# with columns: name (text), avatar (text), score (int4), created_at (timestamptz)
# Paste your project keys below.
# If left blank, the game falls back to local browser storage.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
